| critic | 53 | 20 | 0 | 0 / 20 = 0.0% | 1 | 1 / 20 = 5.0% | 10.0 (997 words) |
| ally | 15 | 6 | 1 | 0 / 6 = 0.0% | 1 | 0 / 6 = 0.0% | 0.0 (267 words) |

